:R-HSA-190840  a            owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Through videomicroscopy, a saltatory transport of connexon vesicles along curvilinear microtubules from the Golgi to the plasma membrane has been observed (Lauf et al., 2002). Such a transport system has been described for similar secretory vesicles (Toomre et al., 1999)." ;
        rdfs:label          "Microtubule-dependent trafficking of connexons from Golgi to the plasma membrane" ;
        dc:contributor      "Authored: Gilleron, J, Segretain, D, Falk, MM, 2007-01-03 12:23:09" , "Edited: Matthews, L, 2007-04-12 12:59:16" , "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
